WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.858
In this lesson we build card visuals and add text boxes as titles.

2
00:00:05.858 --> 00:00:09.980
Our Product table has twenty two products in three categories.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.306
On the report page, a card shows one number.

4
00:00:25.306 --> 00:00:28.245
This card shows the Number of Products measure:

5
00:00:28.245 --> 00:00:28.980
twenty two.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.208
I create a second measure, Number of Category, using COUNT on the Category column,

7
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.440
and show it in another card.

8
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.139
To copy a visual quickly, select it, press Control C and Control V, then

9
00:01:03.139 --> 00:01:05.341
drag the new field into it.

10
00:01:05.341 --> 00:01:10.480
Keep cards the same size and line them up, so the page looks tidy.

11
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.556
Next, a text box.

12
00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:43.003
On the Insert tab, click Text box and type a short title, such as

13
00:01:43.003 --> 00:01:44.170
Count or DistinctCount.

14
00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:48.060
Use the font, size, and bold buttons to format it.

15
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.112
Titles tell the reader what each group of numbers means.

16
00:02:16.112 --> 00:02:22.280
Here, the first row shows COUNT results, and the second row will show DISTINCTCOUNT results.

17
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.800
Now I start the next measure, Number of Products Remove Duplicates, with DISTINCTCOUNT.

